From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cinders of Chaos <noreply@cindersofchaos.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:38:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Updater: our releases, build number, files the install
 keeps

The self-updater checks the releases of our repository instead of
upstream (CMake DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY, default
lucas1089/cinders-of-chaos): it reads update-manifest.json of the
rolling release DME_UPDATE_TAG (mapeditor-latest), which the release
job of our build workflow moves to the newest tested build. The
download must be a *-windows-x64.zip of a release of that repository;
size and SHA-256 are checked as before.

Version: DME_BUILD_NUMBER (the CI run number) is appended to the
upstream version (1.1.43 -> 1.1.43.N), so every newer build of ours is
newer for the updater. Empty for local builds.

The updater never overwrites the files listed in update-keep.txt of the
program folder (one relative path per line). The game package lists
its data/1098 files there, so an update keeps the game's monsters and
items.

Upstream's update check and its release tag are no longer used.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 editor/core/updateservice.cpp | 25 +++++++++++++++++++------
 editor/updater/main.cpp       | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 30311ba..7a8806d 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -7,8 +7,28 @@ set(QT_CREATOR_SKIP_VCPKG_SETUP ON CACHE BOOL
 
 project(DewralMapEditor VERSION 1.1.43 LANGUAGES C CXX)
 
-set(DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY "dewral/DewralMapEditor" CACHE STRING
+set(DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY "lucas1089/cinders-of-chaos" CACHE STRING
     "GitHub repository hosting the stable update packages")
+# Cinders Map Editor: the updater reads update-manifest.json of this release tag of DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY
+# (a rolling release, moved by the release job of our build workflow to the newest tested build).
+set(DME_UPDATE_TAG "mapeditor-latest" CACHE STRING
+    "Release tag whose update-manifest.json names the newest build")
+# Our builds count up: the version is the upstream version plus this number (the CI run number), so a newer
+# build is always "newer" for the updater. Empty for local builds.
+set(DME_BUILD_NUMBER "" CACHE STRING "Build number appended to the version")
+if(NOT DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY MATCHES "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+/[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$")
+    message(FATAL_ERROR "DME_RELEASE_REPOSITORY must be a GitHub owner/repository")
+endif()
+if(NOT DME_UPDATE_TAG MATCHES "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+$")
+    message(FATAL_ERROR "DME_UPDATE_TAG must be a plain release tag")
+endif()
+if(DME_BUILD_NUMBER STREQUAL "")
+    set(DME_APP_VERSION "${PROJECT_VERSION}")
+elseif(DME_BUILD_NUMBER MATCHES "^[0-9]+$")
+    set(DME_APP_VERSION "${PROJECT_VERSION}.${DME_BUILD_NUMBER}")
+else()
+    message(FATAL_ERROR "DME_BUILD_NUMBER must be a number")
+endif()
 
 set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17)
